              "Southbridge (I/O Controller Hub / PCH): Manages lower-speed peripherals — SATA ports, USB ports, on board audio, Ethernet LAN, BIOS, Pie x1 slots, CMOS/RTC. In our H81 motherboard, the chip labelled 'Intel H81' is the Southbridge (also called PCH - Platform Controller Hub).",
