    connection: "This week extends networking skills to advanced topics: Virtual Networks using Hyper-V (creating isolated test environments), VPN (Virtual Private Network) for secure remote access, and router management. These skills are valuable for IT infrastructure roles in government offices and private companies. Hyper-V allows us to run multiple operating systems on one physical machine — essential for testing without risking the main system. VPN knowledge is increasingly important as more organizations support remote work.",
